      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/network_scope",
      "description": "Indicates whether the endpoint resides inside the customer\u2019s network, outside on the Internet, or if its location relative to the customer\u2019s network cannot be determined. The value is normalized to the caption of the <code>network_scope_id</code>.",
      "title": "Network Scope",
