      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/algorithm",
      "description": "The algorithm or scheme used to create the fingerprint, normalized to the caption of <code>algorithm_id</code>. In the case of <code>Other</code>, it is defined by the event source.",
