          "annotations": {}
        }
      },
      "description": "When <code>type_id</code> is <code>Execute (2)</code>, this describes the command line that is executed.<br/><br/>When <code>type_id</code> is <code>COM Handler (1)</code>, this <em>may</em> describe the DLL path stored in the COM component's <code>InprocServer32</code> key or the command line stored in the COM component's <code>LocalServer32</code> key.",
      "title": "Command Line",
