      "description": "An ordered array of Logger objects describing each hop in the event pipeline between the source and its final destination. Each entry captures the logging product, device, and timestamps (<code>logged_time</code>, <code>transmit_time</code>) at that stage. The last entry's <code>logged_time</code> should match <code>metadata.logged_time</code>.",
      "title": "Loggers",
