          "@type": "Annotation"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Describes the affected device/host. It can be used in conjunction with <code>resources</code> or when there are multiple devices affected. E.g. The role of the device as target or actor, specific details about a cloud resource compute instance, etc.<p>If a single device is the source of the finding, use the <code>Host</code> profile and populate <code>device</code>.</p>",
      "title": "Device",
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/ocsf_objects",
