      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/src_endpoint",
      "description": "The source endpoint of the network activity \u2014 typically the initiator. In bi-flow or asymmetric flow scenarios, this endpoint may represent the response side of communication originally initiated by the destination. Use <code>initiator_id</code> to determine which endpoint actually initiated the communication.",
      "title": "Source Endpoint",
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/ocsf_objects",
